t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">To sell/Make into jam</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>Coconuts are large, brown fruit with a hard shell and sweet, refreshing water inside.</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Coconut</b> is a item that can be found on <a href=\"/wiki/Palm\" title=\"Palm\">Palm</a> trees.\n</p><p>It may be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\"><b>Jer Junkman</b></a> for $100 per <b>Coconut</b>. In its jam form it may be sold for $400.\n</p><p>Gives a tree climbing ability when put into a jar and drunk.\n</p><p>When put into a <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, the fill level increases by ~3.34% per coconut.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Fruits_Nav\" tit